    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/as-pure-h/q11-question-1.svg\" alt=\"Prove that the sum of two positive even consecutive powers of 2 is always a multiple of 20 . 5 ( )\" style=\"--madas-width:569.3px\"></figure>",
